esourceReadResult>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L38","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:38"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reads an MCP resource by URI. Used by the chat manager to eagerly fetch\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ui://"},{"type":"text","value":" resource widgets (MCP Apps) after a tool result resolves."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional — sources that do not serve "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ui://"},{"type":"text","value":" resources need not implement\nthis method. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ai-mcp"},{"type":"text","value":"'s "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MCPClient"},{"type":"text","value":" satisfies this structurally."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"uri","children":[{"type":"text","value":"uri"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"McpResourceReadResult"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tools"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tools: (options?) => Promise<AnyServerTool[]>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L29","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:29"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"lazy","children":[{"type":"text","value":"lazy?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AnyServerTool.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyServerTool"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[]>"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"close","text":"close","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"readresource","text":"readResource?","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"uri","text":"uri","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"tools","text":"tools","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":5},{"id":"lazy","text":"lazy?","level":6},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L25)\n\nMinimal structural shape that `chat({ mcp })` needs from an MCP client.\n\n`@tanstack/ai-mcp`'s `MCPClient` and `MCPClients` satisfy this interface by\nshape — the core `@tanstack/ai` package does NOT import `@tanstack/ai-mcp`\n(ai-mcp depends on ai, not the reverse).\n\n## Properties\n\n### close\n\n```ts\nclose: () => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L30)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### readResource?\n\n```ts\noptional readResource?: (uri) => Promise<McpResourceReadResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L38)\n\nReads an MCP resource by URI. Used by the chat manager to eagerly fetch\n`ui://` resource widgets (MCP Apps) after a tool result resolves.\n\nOptional — sources that do not serve `ui://` resources need not implement\nthis method. `ai-mcp`'s `MCPClient` satisfies this structurally.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### uri\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`McpResourceReadResult`\\>\n\n***\n\n### tools\n\n```ts\ntools: (options?) => Promise<AnyServerTool[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L29)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options?\n\n###### lazy?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`AnyServerTool`](../type-aliases/AnyServerTool.md)[]\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MCPToolSource\ntitle: MCPToolSource\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:25](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L25)\n\nMinimal structural shape that `chat({ mcp })` needs from an MCP client.\n\n`@tanstack/ai-mcp`'s `MCPClient` and `MCPClients` satisfy this interface by\nshape — the core `@tanstack/ai` package does NOT import `@tanstack/ai-mcp`\n(ai-mcp depends on ai, not the reverse).\n\n## Properties\n\n### close\n\n```ts\nclose: () => Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L30)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### readResource?\n\n```ts\noptional readResource?: (uri) => Promise<McpResourceReadResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:38](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L38)\n\nReads an MCP resource by URI. Used by the chat manager to eagerly fetch\n`ui://` resource widgets (MCP Apps) after a tool result resolves.\n\nOptional — sources that do not serve `ui://` resources need not implement\nthis method. `ai-mcp`'s `MCPClient` satisfies this structurally.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### uri\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`McpResourceReadResult`\\>\n\n***\n\n### tools\n\n```ts\ntools: (options?) => Promise<AnyServerTool[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/mcp/types.ts#L29)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options?\n\n###### lazy?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`AnyServerTool`](../type-aliases/AnyServerTool.md)[]\\>\n"}
